# Romanian weekday, bare and with the enclitic definite article.  The
# articulated form (sâmbăta) is the ordinary written shape in
# "sâmbăta trecută/viitoare" (= last/next Saturday).  Definite article of the
# days of the week per dexonline / DOOM.
# https://dexonline.ro/definitie/sâmbătă
sâmbătă
sambata
sâmbăta
